### **3. Browser Extension for Backend Communication**

#### **Manifest Setup**
`manifest.json`:
```json
{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "PinkSync Translator",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "Translation and Accessibility Node Management",
  "permissions": ["storage", "tabs", "activeTab", "scripting"],
  "host_permissions": ["https://api.pinksync.com/*"],
  "background": {
    "service_worker": "background.js"
  },
  "action": {
    "default_popup": "popup.html",
    "default_icon": {
      "16": "icons/icon16.png",
      "48": "icons/icon48.png",
      "128": "icons/icon128.png"
    }
  }
}
```

